    </div><div style="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid"><p style="margin: 0pt"></p><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse"><tr style="vertical-align: top"><td style="width: 78%; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt"> <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>VERSUS SYSTEMS INC.</b></p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">NOTES TO THE CONDENSED INTERIM CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">FOR THE NINE MONTH PERIOD ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2023</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">(Expressed in United States dollars)</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">(Unaudited)</p></td><td style="width: 22%; padding-right: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; text-align: right"><img alt="" src="ex99-1_002.jpg" style="height: 77px; width: 87px"/></td></tr></table><p style="margin: 0pt">&#160;</p></div><div>
