    </div><!-- Field: /Page --><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 0in"></td><td style="width: 0.5in; text-align: left"><b>9.</b></td><td style="text-align: justify"><b>ACQUISITION OF XCITE INTERACTIVE, INC. (continued)</b></td>
</tr></table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><ix:continuation id="_AssetAcquisitionTextBlock-c0_cont_2"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in"><b><i>D) Revenue and Profit Contribution
</i></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in">The acquired business contributed revenues of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:OtherRevenue" scale="0" unitRef="usd">216,296</ix:nonFraction> and
$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:OtherRevenue" scale="0" unitRef="usd">770,251</ix:nonFraction> for the nine month period ended September 30, 2023 and 2022, respectively.</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfIntangibleAssetsExplanatory"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 0in"></td><td style="width: 0.5in; text-align: left"><b>10.</b></td><td style="text-align: justify"><b>INTANGIBLE ASSETS</b></td>
</tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">Intangible assets are comprised of
a business-to-business software platform that allows video game publishers and developers to offer prize-based matches of their games
to their players. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="vs_ScheduleOfIntangibleAssetsTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="vs:ScheduleOfIntangibleAssetsTableTextBlock">The Company continues to develop new apps, therefore additional costs were capitalized during the nine month period
ended September 30, 2023.</ix:nonNumeric></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:continuation id="vs_ScheduleOfIntangibleAssetsTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
