</tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 28.35pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="vs_DisclosureOfLeaseLiabilityTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="vs:DisclosureOfLeaseLiabilityTableTextBlock"><b>Lease Liabilities</b></ix:nonNumeric></p>

